    AND `s 254(c)(6) the agreement's provision for cash in lieu of fractions is permitted` agreement

§§ `s 254(d) adoption, filing and the certificate`

-- Each constituent entity adopts the agreement in its own way: a stock corporation "in the same manner as is provided in section
-- 251", a nonstock corporation "in the same manner as is provided in section 255" (dg7), a joint-stock association "in accordance
-- with the laws of the jurisdiction under which [it is] formed or organized".
-- src:1159 | The agreement required by subsection (c) of this section shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the stock or nonstock corporations in the same manner as is provided in § 251 or § 255 of this title, respectively, and in the case of the joint-stock associations in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction under which they are formed or organized. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(d) (src:1159)
DECLARE `s 254(d) Kind of constituent entity` IS ONE OF
    `a stock corporation constituent of the merger or consolidation`
    `a nonstock corporation constituent of the merger or consolidation`
    `a joint-stock association constituent of the merger or consolidation`

-- src:1159 | The agreement required by subsection (c) of this section shall be adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the stock or nonstock corporations in the same manner as is provided in § 251 or § 255 of this title, respectively, and in the case of the joint-stock associations in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction under which they are formed or organized. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(d) (src:1159)
GIVEN constituent                                                                 IS A `s 254(d) Kind of constituent entity`
      `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN -- the rule `s 251(a) the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251`
      `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 255` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN -- out of range: section 255 (piece dg7)
      `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by the joint-stock association in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction under which it is formed or organized` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: the laws of the other jurisdictions
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 254(d) the constituent entity has adopted and approved the agreement as the subsection requires` constituent `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251` `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 255` `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by the joint-stock association in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction under which it is formed or organized` MEANS
    CONSIDER constituent
    WHEN `a stock corporation constituent of the merger or consolidation`     THEN `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251`
    WHEN `a nonstock corporation constituent of the merger or consolidation`  THEN `the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 255`
    WHEN `a joint-stock association constituent of the merger or consolidation` THEN JUST `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged by the joint-stock association in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction under which it is formed or organized`

-- src:1159 | The agreement shall be filed and shall become effective for all purposes of the laws of this State when and as provided in § 251 of this title with respect to the merger or consolidation of corporations of this State. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(d) (src:1159)
GIVEN `the date on which a merger or consolidation of corporations of this State would become effective under s 251 (in accordance with s 103)` IS A DATE -- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 254(d) the date on which the agreement becomes effective for all purposes of the laws of this State` `the date on which a merger or consolidation of corporations of this State would become effective under s 251 (in accordance with s 103)` MEANS
    `the date on which a merger or consolidation of corporations of this State would become effective under s 251 (in accordance with s 103)`

-- The certificate in lieu, one field per limb (d)(1) to (d)(8). (d)(8) is "the agreement, if any, required by section 252(d)": read
-- as needed when the surviving or resulting entity is a joint-stock association formed under the laws of a jurisdiction other than
-- this State, which section 254(e) makes a "corporation" for section 252(d) (NOTES.md fork register F13).
