        certificate's `executed in accordance with s 103`
    AND certificate's `states the name, jurisdiction of formation or organization and type of entity of each of the constituent entities`
    AND certificate's `states that an agreement of merger or consolidation has been approved, adopted, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the constituent entities in accordance with s 254(d)`
    AND certificate's `states the name of the surviving or resulting corporation or joint-stock association`
    AND (CONSIDER kind
         WHEN `a merger into a single surviving corporation`
              THEN (    (NOT `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation of this State`)
                     OR certificate's `states the amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation, or that it stays as it is`)
         WHEN `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation`
              THEN (    (NOT `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation of this State`)
                     OR certificate's `states that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation is as set forth in an attachment to the certificate`))
    AND certificate's `states that the executed agreement is on file at an office of the surviving or resulting corporation or joint-stock association, with the address`
    AND certificate's `states that a copy of the agreement will be furnished on request and without cost to any stockholder or member of any constituent entity`
    AND (    (NOT `the surviving or resulting entity is a joint-stock association formed under the laws of a jurisdiction other than this State`)
          OR certificate's `states the agreement, if any, required by s 252(d)`)

-- (d)(7): a copy on request and without cost, for any stockholder or member of any constituent entity.
-- src:1166 | (7) That a copy of the agreement of consolidation or merger will be furnished by the surviving or resulting corporation or joint-stock association, on request and without cost, to any stockholder or member of any constituent entity; and
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(d)(7) (src:1166)
GIVEN `a certificate of merger or consolidation was filed in lieu of filing the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a stockholder or member of a constituent entity`                      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 254(d)(7) the stockholder or member may request a copy of the agreement without cost` `a certificate of merger or consolidation was filed in lieu of filing the agreement` `the person is a stockholder or member of a constituent entity` MEANS
        `a certificate of merger or consolidation was filed in lieu of filing the agreement`
    AND `the person is a stockholder or member of a constituent entity`

§§ `s 254(e) sections that apply, and the personal liability of a stockholder`

-- "Sections 251(d), 251(e) to the extent the surviving entity is a corporation of this State, 251(f), 252(d), 259 through 262 and
-- 328 shall, insofar as they are applicable, apply to mergers or consolidations between corporations and joint-stock associations."
-- src:1168 | Sections 251(d), 251(e) to the extent the surviving entity is a corporation of this State, §§ 251(f), 252(d), 259 through 262 and 328 of this title shall, insofar as they are applicable, apply to mergers or consolidations between corporations and joint-stock associations; the word “corporation” where applicable, as used in those sections, being deemed to include joint-stock associations as defined herein. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(e) (src:1168)
DECLARE `s 254(e) Section that applies` IS ONE OF
    `section 251(d) applied by s 254(e)`
    `section 251(e) applied by s 254(e)`
    `section 251(f) applied by s 254(e)`
    `section 252(d) applied by s 254(e)`
    `sections 259 through 262 applied by s 254(e)`
    `section 328 applied by s 254(e)`

-- src:1168 | Sections 251(d), 251(e) to the extent the surviving entity is a corporation of this State, §§ 251(f), 252(d), 259 through 262 and 328 of this title shall, insofar as they are applicable, apply to mergers or consolidations between corporations and joint-stock associations; the word “corporation” where applicable, as used in those sections, being deemed to include joint-stock associations as defined herein. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(e) (src:1168)
GIVEN section                                                                IS A `s 254(e) Section that applies`
      `the surviving entity is a corporation of this State`                  IS A BOOLEAN
      `the section is applicable to the merger or consolidation by its own terms` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: sections 252(d), 259 to 262 (dg6, dg7) and 328 (dg10)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 254(e) the section applies to the merger or consolidation of a corporation and a joint-stock association` section `the surviving entity is a corporation of this State` `the section is applicable to the merger or consolidation by its own terms` MEANS
    CONSIDER section
    WHEN `section 251(d) applied by s 254(e)`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `section 251(e) applied by s 254(e)`                THEN `the surviving entity is a corporation of this State`
    WHEN `section 251(f) applied by s 254(e)`                THEN `the section is applicable to the merger or consolidation by its own terms`
    WHEN `section 252(d) applied by s 254(e)`                THEN `the section is applicable to the merger or consolidation by its own terms`
    WHEN `sections 259 through 262 applied by s 254(e)`      THEN `the section is applicable to the merger or consolidation by its own terms`
    WHEN `section 328 applied by s 254(e)`                   THEN `the section is applicable to the merger or consolidation by its own terms`

-- "the word 'corporation' where applicable, as used in those sections, being deemed to include joint-stock associations as defined
-- herein."
-- src:1168 | the word “corporation” where applicable, as used in those sections, being deemed to include joint-stock associations as defined herein. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(e) (src:1168)
GIVEN `the word corporation is used in a section that s 254(e) applies and the reading is applicable` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 254(e) the word corporation in the applied section is deemed to include a joint-stock association` `the word corporation is used in a section that s 254(e) applies and the reading is applicable` MEANS
    `the word corporation is used in a section that s 254(e) applies and the reading is applicable`

-- "Where the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation, ... the personal liability, if any, of any stockholder of a
-- joint-stock association existing at the time of such merger or consolidation shall not thereby be extinguished, shall remain
-- personal to such stockholder and shall not become the liability of any subsequent transferee of any share of stock in such
-- surviving or resulting corporation or of any other stockholder of such surviving or resulting corporation."
-- Without a corporate survivor, or without any such liability, the sentence says nothing (NOTHING).
-- src:1168 | Where the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation, for purposes of the laws of this State, the personal liability, if any, of any stockholder of a joint-stock association existing at the time of such merger or consolidation shall not thereby be extinguished …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(e) (src:1168)
GIVEN `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation`                                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
      `the stockholder had personal liability as a stockholder of the joint-stock association at the time of the merger or consolidation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 254(e) the stockholder's personal liability is extinguished by the merger or consolidation` `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation` `the stockholder had personal liability as a stockholder of the joint-stock association at the time of the merger or consolidation` MEANS
    IF    `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation`
       AND `the stockholder had personal liability as a stockholder of the joint-stock association at the time of the merger or consolidation`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE NOTHING

-- src:1168 | shall remain personal to such stockholder and shall not become the liability of any subsequent transferee of any share of stock in such surviving or resulting corporation or of any other stockholder of such surviving or resulting corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(e) (src:1168)
GIVEN `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation`                                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
      `the stockholder had personal liability as a stockholder of the joint-stock association at the time of the merger or consolidation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 254(e) the stockholder's personal liability becomes the liability of a subsequent transferee or of another stockholder of the surviving or resulting corporation` `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation` `the stockholder had personal liability as a stockholder of the joint-stock association at the time of the merger or consolidation` MEANS
    IF    `the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation`
       AND `the stockholder had personal liability as a stockholder of the joint-stock association at the time of the merger or consolidation`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE NOTHING

§§ `s 254(f) charitable status`

-- "Nothing in this section shall be deemed to authorize the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation or charitable joint-stock
-- association into a stock corporation or joint-stock association if the charitable status ... would be thereby lost or impaired".
-- Where it applies the section does not authorize the merger (FALSE); otherwise the sentence says nothing (NOTHING).
-- src:1169 | Nothing in this section shall be deemed to authorize the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation or charitable joint-stock association into a stock corporation or joint-stock association if the charitable status of such nonstock corporation or joint-stock association would be thereby lost or impaired …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(f) (src:1169)
GIVEN `the merging entity is a charitable nonstock corporation or a charitable joint-stock association`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is to be merged into a stock corporation or a joint-stock association`                         IS A BOOLEAN
      `its charitable status would be lost or impaired by the merger`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 254(f) this section authorizes the merger of the charitable entity` `the merging entity is a charitable nonstock corporation or a charitable joint-stock association` `it is to be merged into a stock corporation or a joint-stock association` `its charitable status would be lost or impaired by the merger` MEANS
    IF    `the merging entity is a charitable nonstock corporation or a charitable joint-stock association`
       AND `it is to be merged into a stock corporation or a joint-stock association`
       AND `its charitable status would be lost or impaired by the merger`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE NOTHING

-- "but a stock corporation or a joint-stock association may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation or charitable
-- joint-stock association which shall continue as the surviving corporation or joint-stock association."
-- src:1169 | but a stock corporation or a joint-stock association may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation or charitable joint-stock association which shall continue as the surviving corporation or joint-stock association.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 254(f) (src:1169)
GIVEN `the merging entity is a stock corporation or a joint-stock association`                                             IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is merged into a charitable nonstock corporation or charitable joint-stock association that continues as the surviving corporation or joint-stock association` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 254(f) a stock corporation or a joint-stock association may be merged into the charitable entity` `the merging entity is a stock corporation or a joint-stock association` `it is merged into a charitable nonstock corporation or charitable joint-stock association that continues as the surviving corporation or joint-stock association` MEANS
    IF    `the merging entity is a stock corporation or a joint-stock association`
       AND `it is merged into a charitable nonstock corporation or charitable joint-stock association that continues as the surviving corporation or joint-stock association`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING
